      "text": "14 PROGRAM PAGES \u2014 every word is the client's own, verbatim from their live site.\n\nFIXED THIS ROUND:\n\u00b7 The gold wash really is there now. A generated section wrapper was never closing, so each\n  wash layer stretched over the whole page and its glow fell outside the visible area.\n\u00b7 Brazilian Jiu Jitsu is now generated like every other page, so it has the framed hero,\n  the centred title and the same spacing. It also carries Bryan Tidwell's real photo and bio.\n\u00b7 SCHEDULE rebuilt as ONE grid, so every column and time row lines up by construction.\n  Class names break at their own colon, with the level in gold underneath.\n\u00b7 Cards restyled: thin gold outline and a small gold accent instead of the heavy left bar.\n\nCLASS TIMES ARE SHARED \u2014 no page has a schedule typed into it; all read data/classes.json."
    },
